          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_a492e09015ac4f3f47dd",
          "document_start": 769,
          "document_end": 867,
          "text": "其基本思想是：在结构的有限元模型的基础上，把系统看成子结构的组合体，先逐个分析规模小得多的子结构，得到各子结构的主要模态，然后借助于结构交界面上的对接条件，把它们装配成综合系统优势模态的特征方程。",
          "section_id": "section_92dd7d4d544d",
          "start": 769,
          "end": 867,
          "chunk_start": 769,
          "chunk_end": 867,
          "sentence_document_start": 769,
          "sentence_document_end": 867,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_8a7e2bff18d054442ce4",
          "document_start": 867,
          "document_end": 897,
          "text": "具体实施步骤为：首先将所研究的系统分割为若干部件，即子结构；",
          "section_id": "section_92dd7d4d544d",
          "start": 867,
          "end": 897,
          "chunk_start": 867,
          "chunk_end": 897,
          "sentence_document_start": 867,
          "sentence_document_end": 897,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_e0595e74c7866d5f986c",
          "document_start": 897,
          "document_end": 914,
          "text": "接着建立各部件的模态集及模态坐标；",
          "section_id": "section_92dd7d4d544d",
          "start": 897,
          "end": 914,
          "chunk_start": 897,
          "chunk_end": 914,
          "sentence_document_start": 897,
          "sentence_document_end": 914,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_388a92bdf0c53aecb782",
          "document_start": 914,
          "document_end": 955,
          "text": "然后利用部件界面上的连接条件将各部件独立的模态坐标耦联起来，组装成系统的运动方程；",
          "section_id": "section_92dd7d4d544d",
          "start": 914,
          "end": 955,
          "chunk_start": 914,
          "chunk_end": 955,
          "sentence_document_start": 914,
          "sentence_document_end": 955,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_977297901b820ccc9493",
          "document_start": 955,
          "document_end": 1008,
          "text": "最后将系统运动方程的模态坐标解通过相应的变换返回到物理坐标上，得出位移、速度、加速度及应力应变等动态响应。",
          "section_id": "section_92dd7d4d544d",
          "start": 955,
